//地面を見詰めていた。
  A sudden slap on my shoulder jostles me from my thoughts.

  I realize that I was staring at the ground, my head drooping lower by the second. It is, of course, my mother who saved me from planting my face in the dirt.

//　そのまま突っ伏す前に俺を引き止めてくれたのは、
//養母だった。

pt:
